<title>USA: SOS Staffing Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>SOS Staffing Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOS STAFFING SERVICES INC</p>
<p>					 13 weeks ended  52 weeks ended</p>
<p>				   12/29/96 12/31/95 12/29/96 12/31/95</p>
<p> Service revenues	     $43,330 $24,199 $136,164  $87,533</p>
<p> Cost of services		34,854  19,215  108,589   69,353</p>
<p> Gross profit		     8,476   4,984   27,575   18,180</p>
<p> SG&amp;A				 6,584   4,034   20,868   13,859</p>
<p> Operating income		 1,892     950    6,707    4,321</p>
<p> Other income (expense)	 (135)	54    (196)	 85</p>
<p> Income before income taxes   1,757   1,004    6,511    4,406</p>
<p> Income taxes		     (675)   (420)  (2,482)  (1,729)</p>
<p> Net income			 1,082     584    4,029    2,677</p>
<p> Net EPS			     0.15    0.09     0.59     0.43</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs		    7,073   6,733    6,838    6,229</p>
<p>			(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Income taxes, net income, and net EPS are pro forma for year-to-date 199. Pro forma income taxes for year to date 1995 represent amounts necessary to make results comparable due to the Company's termination of its S-Corp status and election of C-Corp status which occurred on June 26, 1995.</p>
</text>
